invariant: INV-16
file: aead.c
catches: test/docker-aes-runtime-qemu.sh x86-kernels
reason: the MAC hands its ciphertext to the update that reads no
  description of the CPU, so no record or packet runs the AVX2 Poly1305
  and CH_CPU_AVX2 picks nothing for it. Every tag passes, because the
  128-bit path computes the same accumulator; only the time is wrong.
  bin/x86_kernels_test counts the kernel's calls for each seal and open
  under every ch_cfg.cpu value, and the script builds it for x86-64.

--- old
    widemul_poly1305_update_cpu(cpu, widemul, &p, ct, n);
--- new
    (void)cpu;
    widemul_poly1305_update(widemul, &p, ct, n);
